namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamShaderBrowserUserSettings {
    at    Source/DreamShaderEditor/Private/UI/DreamShaderBrowserUserSettings.h#DreamShaderBrowserUserSettings
    src   "Per-user, per-project state of the Material Content Browser: which mode it was in, how the three\npanes were split, which filters were on, what was selected. Saved so the tab reopens the way it\nwas closed rather than reset to defaults every session. Nothing in here is project content."
}

